sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Organizer
    participant P2 as Web BFF
    participant P3 as Gateway
    participant P4 as Events API
    participant P5 as Events DB
    participant P6 as Outbox/Broker
    P1->>P2: Submit event
    P2->>P3: Forward bearer request
    P3->>P4: Validate owner / fields
    P4->>P5: Commit event
    P5->>P6: Publish outbox event
    P6-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
